     "en": "A short story"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "Ravi walked around a triangular park whose sides were 30 m, 40 m and 50 m.\n\"I walked 120 metres,\" he said."
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "explain",
    "type": "explanation",
    "provenance": "original",
